PDF: Impress handouts

A PDF export with ExportHandouts (slides per handout page: 1, 2, 3,
4, 6 or 9) lays the shown slides of PageRange on handout pages, the
print dialog's way; three a page leave lines for notes. Other counts
give no pages, and the export fails.

